g and that's a  great therapeutic recipe yeah it works  for both actually so both of them are  helping each other without them knowing  it yeah it's a really special bond that  forms i'm sure and you couldn't do all  of these things without the support of  the community i'm sure let's talk about  this upcoming golf tournament you're  hosting yeah we have a charity golf  tournament at revere in  in henderson coming up june 10th all the  information is on our website you can go  to  betsandhorses.org everything is on there  love to have everybody come out and play  golf enjoy the day and support a great  cause it does take a lot  to help the vets we do more than just  the econ therapy we do brain paint would  help us with ptsd and we have to pay you  know technicians and different things  like that so the costs got up very  quickly and just really quickly if  someone is watching let's say there's a  veteran out there who is in need of your  services what's the best way for them to  get in contact with you same thing  through the website everything is on the  website you can get in contact everybody  will get back with you  as soon as we possibly can to get you  out and get you evaluated  and try to help you out we you know  we'll do our best to help everybody we  don't have all the answers but we'll try  to find the correct answer for them well  jay thank you so much for everything  you're doing in our community and any  way that we can help support you we're  always happy to do that so thank you so  much all the information will be on your  screen here for that golf tournament  friday june 10th at revere golf club in  henderson 7 a.m tea time thank you jay
 

